{% comment %}
  VAULTGUARDS - Contact Section (Shopify NATIVE contact form)
  No API key, no backend, no third-party service. Submits straight to
  whatever email is set in: Shopify Admin > Settings > Notifications >
  "Contact form" recipient (defaults to the store customer email).

  This theme only exposes a JSON view for page templates (no plain Liquid
  template file to paste into), so this ships as a SECTION instead. Sections
  are added on top of the page through the theme editor.

  INSTALL:
  1. Admin > Online Store > Themes > Edit code.
  2. In the left sidebar, find "Sections" > click the plus icon next to it >
     name the new file "vg-contact" (it will be saved as
     sections/vg-contact.liquid) > select all the placeholder text > delete >
     paste this whole file in > Save.
  3. Online Store > Pages > Add page (or edit your existing Contact page) >
     Title it "Contact" > Save. Note the page URL handle shown on that
     screen (for example "contact").
  4. Go to Online Store > Themes > Customize.
  5. At the very top of the Customize screen there is a page picker
     dropdown. Switch it to "Pages" > choose the "Contact" page you just
     created.
  6. In the left panel, scroll to the bottom of the section list and click
     "Add section" > find "Vaultguards Contact" > click it to add it.
  7. Remove or hide any other sections already on this page template so only
     Vaultguards Contact shows.
  8. Click Save in the top right.
  9. Check Settings > Notifications > scroll to "Contact form" > confirm the
     recipient email is paul@vaultguards.co (this is where messages from this
     form will be sent).
{% endcomment %}

<section class="vg-section vg-container" style="max-width:640px;">
  <h1 style="margin-bottom:8px;">Contact Us</h1>
  <p style="color:var(--vg-text-muted); margin-bottom:32px;">
    Questions about fit, colorways, or an order? Send us a message and we will get back to you.
  </p>

  {% form 'contact' %}
    {% if form.posted_successfully? %}
      <div class="vg-card" style="padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px; border-left:4px solid var(--vg-gold-400);">
        <strong>Thanks - your message was sent.</strong><br>
        We will reply to your email as soon as we can.
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if form.errors %}
      <div class="vg-card" style="padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px; border-left:4px solid #c0392b;">
        <strong>Please fix the following:</strong>
        <ul style="margin:8px 0 0 20px;">
          {% for field in form.errors %}
            <li>{{ form.errors.translated_fields[field] | capitalize }} {{ form.errors.messages[field] }}</li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="vg-form-field">
      <label for="ContactFormName">Name</label>
      <input type="text" id="ContactFormName" name="contact[name]" value="{% if form.name %}{{ form.name }}{% elsif customer %}{{ customer.name }}{% endif %}">
    </div>

    <div class="vg-form-field">
      <label for="ContactFormEmail">Email <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
      <input
        type="email"
        id="ContactFormEmail"
        name="contact[email]"
        autocomplete="email"
        required
        value="{% if form.email %}{{ form.email }}{% elsif customer %}{{ customer.email }}{% endif %}">
    </div>

    <div class="vg-form-field">
      <label for="ContactFormMessage">Message <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
      <textarea id="ContactFormMessage" name="contact[body]" rows="6" required>{% if form.body %}{{ form.body }}{% endif %}</textarea>
    </div>

    <button type="submit" class="vg-btn vg-btn-primary" data-vg-haptic="tap">Send Message</button>
  {% endform %}
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Vaultguards Contact",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
